            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Relative imbalance = |returns − rentals| / (returns + rentals), expressed as a percentage. Only stations with at least 100,000 activity events are included in this ranking to reduce extreme percentages caused by small denominators; this is not an operational alert threshold. Net flow = returns − rentals. Because redistribution is not observed, directional imbalance should not be interpreted as evidence of bike shortages, full stations, or inventory change.'"
